<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Essi issues 6.0 bln esc, 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Banco Essi issues 6.0 bln esc, 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese Banco Essi said that it was offering six billion escudos of subordinated 10-year bonds, paying 50 basis points over the six-month Lisbor rate.  </p>
<p>The issuer has the right to transform the coupon into a fixed eight percent after five years.</p>
<p>The bonds, with a nominal value of 10,000 escudos, will be quoted on the Lisbon bourse.</p>
<p>Payment date is December 1996.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
